       └──────────────────────────────────────┘","","Observer removal:","  • Automatic  ──▶  route popped from stack (back \/ popToRoot)","  • Automatic  ──▶  Router deallocated (sheet dismissed)","  • Manual     ──▶  remove(context:) called explicitly"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"anchor":"Deep-Link-Flow","text":"Deep Link Flow","type":"heading","level":3},{"code":["URL\/Identifier → DeeplinkHandler → DeeplinkRoute → Router.handle(deeplink:)","                      │                  │                   │","                      │                  │                   └── Executes navigation sequence","                      │                  └── Factory creates navigation instructions","                      └── Async conversion with optional data fetching"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"anchor":"Memory-Management","text":"Memory Management","type":"heading","level":2},{"anchor":"Router-Lifecycle","text":"Router Lifecycle","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Routers are retained by their parent ","type":"text"},{"code":"RoutingView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". When a view is dismissed:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The router is deallocated","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Context observers are automatically cleaned up","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Child routers are released"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Context-Cleanup","text":"Context Cleanup","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Context observers registered on a route are automatically removed when that route is popped from the stack. This prevents memory leaks and stale callbacks."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Observer registered on .list route","router.push(.list)","router.add(context: SelectionContext.self) { ... }","","\/\/ When .list is pop